# Lint before done

Before marking any task complete or opening a PR:

1. Run the project linter for the package you changed (FE and/or BE).
2. Fix all reported issues (or document why a finding is deferred).
3. Do not claim done while lint is failing.

If no linter is configured yet, add a minimal one as part of foundation tasks, then run it.
